## 2026-07-11 (cont. 7)
_Fixed the owner-float on giscus comments. Checked giscus source (components/Comment.tsx): author association renders as PLAIN TEXT inside a pill with class `.color-box-border-info` — there is NO `.Label` class, so the earlier `:has(.Label)` never matched. Switched selector to `.gsc-comment:has(.color-box-border-info)` → your (OWNER) comments = blue bubble floated right, visitors (NONE, no pill) = grey left. Alignment via fit-content width + auto margins (works in block or flex). Bundled into PR #21 (feat/giscus-tweaks-no-reactions-no-heading) alongside reactions-off + heading-removed, so it's one deploy. STILL needs live confirmation with a real posted comment; if owner comments don't go blue/right, get the comment's outer HTML from devtools and pin the selector._

